nths off by his boss, who doesn't share his view on working methods, he goes back to Japan, where he used to work 19 years ago, to settle the probate of his girlfriend who left him shortly after marriage without a trace.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7364,\"title\":\"Sahara\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kyY1onYxkKBDlJsheRsVbMaoQEM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CXQ9wYj4n9MBwy2TQ92YaRygWj.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned adventurer and treasure hunter Dirk Pitt, a former Navy SEAL, sets out for the African desert with his wisecracking buddy Al in search of a confederate ironclad battleship rumored to have vanished long ago, the main draw being the treasure supposedly hidden within the lost vessel. When the daring duo come across Dr. Eva Rojas, a beautiful scientist who is juggling an escape from a warlord and a mission to stop the spread of a powerful plague, their desert expedition begins to heat up.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1139817,\"title\":\"Officer Black Belt\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pWOiCearczq7zmWo4ASbUIF6HYS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wSZbtiFIK1fkKZdSRtn2kz2Ttfd.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A talented martial artist who can't walk past a person in need unites with a probation officer to fight and prevent crime as a martial arts officer.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":897160,\"title\":\"Brave Citizen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixQoOExnnvIxYvnqGgfhaWqXeXc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fJRrRn60YzI1hVt4X1BIo6hsM0g.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An expelled boxing champion, who now is a high-school teacher, witnesses intolerable violence and throws her first punch